WEBVTT

00:00.521 --> 00:03.815
JULY 15TH (THURS) 8:30 PM

00:05.901 --> 00:07.944
Dammit… Dammit it all!

00:08.028 --> 00:10.363
I have to warn Yoshikage!

00:11.073 --> 00:12.199
<i>Reimi!</i>

00:12.241 --> 00:14.701
<i>This picture, you took it,
right, Rohan?</i>

00:15.327 --> 00:16.453
<i>Well, yes…</i>

00:16.537 --> 00:19.956
<i>This one is marked
What's special about it?</i>

00:19.748 --> 00:22.625
HAYATO KAWAJIRI

00:20.290 --> 00:22.583
<i>There's a circle around
what looks like a little boy.</i>

00:23.293 --> 00:25.295
<i>Oh, him…</i>

00:25.462 --> 00:27.297
<i>I'm not too concerned with him.</i>

00:27.548 --> 00:30.801
<i>He seemed to be sneaking around,
so I thought I'd document him.</i>

00:31.426 --> 00:34.804
<i>But this boy, Hayato Kawajiri,</i>

00:34.888 --> 00:37.056
<i>has the same last name
as this man here.</i>

00:37.724 --> 00:39.225
<i>Huh? Really?</i>

00:39.351 --> 00:40.352
<i>Look!</i>

00:40.644 --> 00:41.728
<i>Definitely the same.</i>

00:40.936 --> 00:43.521
KOSAKU KAWAJIRI

00:41.770 --> 00:43.543
<i>Weren't you already
investigating him?</i>

00:45.107 --> 00:46.942
<i>You're actually right.</i>

00:48.944 --> 00:53.991
At this rate, it's inevitable
Rohan Kishibe will find Yoshikage!

00:53.157 --> 00:55.492
JULY 15TH (THURS) 8:48 PM

00:57.661 --> 01:00.413
Hayato? Hayato!

01:00.998 --> 01:02.124
Ugh…

01:03.125 --> 01:05.001
Hayato, for the last time!

01:05.085 --> 01:06.836
Now answer me!

01:10.340 --> 01:11.799
Oh, it's you…

01:12.384 --> 01:16.179
I could've sworn
Hayato was in there.

01:16.305 --> 01:18.724
And look at this!

01:18.807 --> 01:20.975
This place looks like
a bomb went off.

01:21.018 --> 01:22.519
His clothes are
all over the hallway.

01:22.561 --> 01:23.520
I wish he'd learn from you.

01:23.562 --> 01:26.022
No matter how many times
I tell him, he's still a slob.

01:26.148 --> 01:28.441
He still won't even answer me.

01:28.483 --> 01:32.612
I'm sure he's reading manga
with his headphones on again.

01:33.197 --> 01:36.909
Oh! Honey, you've got blood
on your fingers.

01:37.075 --> 01:38.242
Are you okay?

01:38.327 --> 01:40.370
I'll go get a bandage.

01:42.664 --> 01:45.208
I-I'll take care of it myself.

01:46.001 --> 01:49.504
I can handle a simple bandage.

01:49.588 --> 01:50.589
Oh…

01:52.883 --> 01:56.094
I caught my fingers in the door,
that's all.

02:05.395 --> 02:07.063
<i>Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

02:07.773 --> 02:09.900
<i>(Listen up)
Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

02:10.651 --> 02:12.569
<i>(Listen)
Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

02:13.862 --> 02:16.906
<i>Breakdown, Breakdown
(3, 2, 1) Let's Go!</i>

02:16.990 --> 02:18.116
JOJO'S BIZARRE ADVENTURE
DIAMOND IS UNBREAKABLE

02:18.200 --> 02:22.700
<i>Shining Justice begins to sprout</i>

02:23.705 --> 02:28.205
<i>Brand-new bed town
Will we meet? Let's find out</i>

02:29.378 --> 02:33.878
<i>Feeling the sea breeze from the cape
through the tunnel to the tower</i>

02:35.008 --> 02:39.508
<i>We wander into the alley,
drawn to each other</i>

02:40.305 --> 02:44.805
<i>A shadow melts into our hearts</i>

02:47.688 --> 02:52.188
<i>But the golden spirits
shine a light to protect us</i>

02:57.572 --> 03:02.072
<i>Let the voice of love
take you higher</i>

03:02.577 --> 03:07.077
<i>Let the gathering forces
overcome time itself</i>

03:08.917 --> 03:13.417
<i>1999 Bizarre Summer</i>

03:13.839 --> 03:18.339
<i>Our courage keeps the town in bloom</i>

03:19.428 --> 03:23.598
<i>Great Days</i>

03:26.018 --> 03:29.062
JULY 15TH (THURS) 8:50 PM

03:28.937 --> 03:29.083
Hayato Kawajiri?

03:30.772 --> 03:31.815
So you think this grade-school kid

03:31.690 --> 03:36.190
EPISODE 35
BITES THE DUST, PART 1

03:31.857 --> 03:33.984
has something to do with
Yoshikage Kira?

03:34.443 --> 03:37.008
Well, we're not totally sure yet,

03:37.529 --> 03:40.490
but Rohan-sensei seems to think
there's something fishy going on.

03:40.824 --> 03:43.368
Well, yeah, I don't know
any grade schoolers

03:43.452 --> 03:46.788
taking videos of their dad
on the down low.

03:46.955 --> 03:50.833
That's why we're talking about
meeting up tomorrow morning

03:50.876 --> 03:53.169
to visit Hayato Kawajiri's
house together.

03:53.170 --> 03:56.047
Rohan-sensei said he already
figured out the address.

03:56.965 --> 03:59.759
The jerk
sure doesn't drag his feet.

03:59.968 --> 04:03.471
Got it. I guess I should probably
invite Okuyasu, right?

04:03.638 --> 04:06.807
And we can't forget about Jotaro.

04:06.892 --> 04:09.561
I'll be sure to get in touch
with Jotaro.

04:09.770 --> 04:11.813
All right. So tomorrow at 8:30 AM.

04:11.855 --> 04:13.940
At the intersection
with the Pepsi sign.

04:13.982 --> 04:15.024
Got it.

04:15.776 --> 04:19.446
8:30, huh?
I'm gonna be late for school.

04:19.780 --> 04:24.280
But something tells me
it's gonna be worth it.

04:32.376 --> 04:33.668
Are you okay?

04:33.710 --> 04:35.712
I can tell something's wrong,
Sweetie…

04:35.837 --> 04:37.547
You're all pale.

04:37.839 --> 04:39.882
Really, it's nothing.

04:39.966 --> 04:41.759
I just slammed my fingers
in the door.

04:41.843 --> 04:43.302
My face shows my pain…

04:44.054 --> 04:46.723
Now, would you please
just go make me some tea?

04:47.015 --> 04:48.850
I'll be right down.

04:52.187 --> 04:53.563
Of course.

04:54.856 --> 04:58.025
I know this is going to sound
totally random,

04:58.110 --> 05:02.072
but lately, you give off
this vibe like you'll live forever.

05:03.865 --> 05:05.449
Well, anyway, your tea.

05:17.295 --> 05:19.046
<i>If anything happens to me,</i>

05:19.089 --> 05:21.466
<i>you can bet your whole cover
will be blown!</i>

05:21.800 --> 05:23.551
<i>Now stay the hell away
from me and my mom!</i>

05:24.094 --> 05:25.553
<i>This isn't some negotiation!</i>

05:25.595 --> 05:28.764
<i>You don't have a choice! Got it?!</i>

05:30.725 --> 05:31.684
<i>How charming!</i>

05:31.726 --> 05:35.062
<i>You think I'd ever let
someone find me out?</i>

05:39.568 --> 05:43.113
You of all people should've known.

05:43.238 --> 05:45.323
Getting rid of Hayato
was the height of foolishness.

05:45.407 --> 05:47.909
I'm trying to think of
an out right now.

05:47.993 --> 05:50.328
It's too late now.

05:51.455 --> 05:53.623
You did a fine job of
making it look as if

05:53.707 --> 05:55.208
he fell and hit his head,

05:55.250 --> 05:57.919
but your timing couldn't be worse.

05:57.961 --> 05:59.545
Rohan Kishibe has already begun

05:59.588 --> 06:02.465
his investigation into
Hayato Kawajiri.

06:02.507 --> 06:06.177
They don't know for sure yet
that Kosaku Kawajiri is you,

06:06.261 --> 06:09.722
but they're coming here tomorrow
to find out.

06:12.934 --> 06:15.478
You mustn't remain in
this house a minute longer.

06:15.520 --> 06:17.855
Will you stop talking…
I'm trying to think.

06:22.986 --> 06:25.154
When things didn't go your way,

06:25.238 --> 06:26.989
when you felt the whole world
was against you…

06:27.032 --> 06:30.702
you'd always bite your nails
till your fingers were raw.

06:32.329 --> 06:34.039
My poor boy.

06:34.122 --> 06:37.500
Oh, the misery
you must be suffering.

06:40.003 --> 06:42.088
There's no other way now.

06:42.130 --> 06:45.174
You must leave this town behind
for good, Yoshikage.

06:45.592 --> 06:50.092
You still have a chance to escape
and hold on to your anonymity.

06:52.641 --> 06:56.102
You want me to run away
and abandon Morioh?

06:56.144 --> 06:59.856
I'm sick to death of living
in the shadow of fear,

06:59.940 --> 07:02.317
of living every moment
in excruciating secrecy…

07:02.359 --> 07:03.985
you know that!

07:04.986 --> 07:07.363
I swear I will never
leave this town.

07:14.287 --> 07:15.871
What?!

07:16.623 --> 07:20.627
The arrow just moved on its own!
I didn't do anything!

07:20.669 --> 07:23.213
I wasn't even touching it!

07:25.006 --> 07:26.799
Th-The arrow…

07:30.220 --> 07:32.013
Y-Yoshikage!

07:43.567 --> 07:46.632
Hayato! Hayato?!

07:45.068 --> 07:46.611
JULY 16TH (FRI) 7:30 AM

07:47.028 --> 07:49.321
Just how long are you going
to stay sleeping, Hayato?

07:49.948 --> 07:51.574
It's time to get up and—

07:53.994 --> 07:58.494
What, you're already
awake? You startled me.

07:59.040 --> 08:00.708
Hayato, breakfast.

08:00.750 --> 08:02.918
Geez, you could at least
try to answer…

08:07.424 --> 08:09.759
<i>I had a terrible
night's sleep last night.</i>

08:10.176 --> 08:14.676
<i>He found out I was a witness
in one of his murders.</i>

08:15.682 --> 08:19.268
<i>For now, I've made sure
he can't lay a finger</i>

08:19.352 --> 08:20.978
<i>on me or Mom, but…</i>

08:22.606 --> 08:24.482
<i>That'll work for only so long…</i>

08:43.376 --> 08:47.876
I-I don't understand…
What's gotten into you, Yoshikage?

08:49.341 --> 08:51.718
You've been acting strange
since last night.

08:53.261 --> 08:55.179
<i>Don't ignore me, Yoshikage!</i>

08:55.263 --> 08:56.514
<i>I don't know why,</i>

08:56.598 --> 09:00.018
<i>but Rohan Kishibe is now keen on
snooping around Hayato Kawajiri!</i>

09:00.101 --> 09:03.687
<i>They're coming to search
the house tomorrow</i>

09:04.773 --> 09:06.649
<i>There's no cause for alarm.</i>

09:06.775 --> 09:09.402
<i>B-But, Yoshikage!</i>

09:12.280 --> 09:16.075
<i>Deadly Queen has
acquired a third ability</i>

09:22.832 --> 09:24.458
<i>I… I don't understand.</i>

09:25.460 --> 09:29.672
What happened that
you can be so lackadaisical?

09:29.464 --> 09:32.008
-MORIOH'S FAMOUS-
MISO-MARINATED COW TONGUE

09:29.923 --> 09:31.591
<i>Miso-marinated cow tongue.</i>

09:35.178 --> 09:37.889
<i>What? You're kidding!
We're on the air?</i>

09:38.723 --> 09:43.223
<i>Er, um… It's 7:55, time for
today's prefectural weather report.</i>

09:44.229 --> 09:47.023
<i>Today we can enjoy sunny skies.</i>

09:47.107 --> 09:51.236
Hayato! Hey, Hayato!
Could you answer the phone…

09:53.196 --> 09:57.158
<i>Ever since that bath last night,
he's changed.</i>

09:57.200 --> 09:59.619
<i>What the hell happened?</i>

10:01.830 --> 10:06.042
Hayato! Please answer the phone!

10:08.002 --> 10:08.919
CRASH

10:10.588 --> 10:12.548
My favorite china tea set!

10:13.633 --> 10:15.092
This is your fault!

10:15.218 --> 10:18.429
Why do you always ignore me?!

10:18.638 --> 10:21.641
Fine! So I'm just
a nuisance to you, huh?!

10:21.975 --> 10:23.851
Then I'll just stay
out of your way!

10:24.894 --> 10:28.564
Now, now. Let's not start
the day off with an argument.

10:29.065 --> 10:31.692
If it can't be fixed,
I'll just buy you another one.

10:32.819 --> 10:34.821
Hello, Kawajiri residence.

10:35.363 --> 10:36.989
No, I'm afraid not.

10:37.449 --> 10:39.534
Wrong number, of course.

10:40.076 --> 10:43.788
Hayato's just going through
a quiet phase.

10:45.582 --> 10:47.750
We're a family,
we should support each other,

10:47.792 --> 10:49.418
not tear each other down.

10:49.502 --> 10:50.836
Support each other, okay.

10:51.463 --> 10:53.631
Well, I suppose I should
get going to work.

10:54.674 --> 10:56.008
I wonder if a certain someone
will allow me

10:56.050 --> 10:57.301
to give her a goodbye kiss?

10:57.385 --> 10:58.386
Huh?

10:58.928 --> 11:00.304
Have a wonderful day…

11:19.908 --> 11:22.035
So he left…

11:22.202 --> 11:23.953
I'm right here, son.

11:25.163 --> 11:27.582
Why don't you let me keep you
company for part of the way?

11:34.005 --> 11:35.923
One moment,
I'm on top of the world,

11:35.965 --> 11:38.258
the next,
I'm in the depths of depression…

11:38.301 --> 11:42.801
So much has happened.
It's been a whirlwind of emotion.

11:43.848 --> 11:48.348
But now I will be able to live
a life free of worry and anxiety.

11:48.686 --> 11:51.313
You really put the pressure on
last night,

11:51.397 --> 11:53.190
but you brought out the best in me…
I matured.

11:54.484 --> 11:58.946
You were so
extraordinarily determined.

11:58.988 --> 12:02.449
Imagine that, you actually
threatened the Yoshikage Kira…

12:02.700 --> 12:05.327
<i>Y- Yoshikage Kira?</i>

12:07.288 --> 12:08.914
Oops, I guess I just
told you my name.

12:09.040 --> 12:11.292
So, does this mean
you're gonna kill me after all?

12:11.334 --> 12:12.543
Kill you?

12:12.627 --> 12:14.712
Because you now know my secret?

12:15.171 --> 12:18.757
I've no need to go down that road.
I've matured.

12:19.342 --> 12:21.761
Nothing you or anyone else
tries to do matters any more…

12:21.803 --> 12:24.138
I am now unrivaled.

12:25.223 --> 12:27.475
You no longer arouse
any interest in me.

12:27.517 --> 12:29.519
Besides, if I wanted to kill you…

12:30.353 --> 12:32.938
I would have done so
a long time ago last night.

12:33.398 --> 12:36.901
We are all going to
get along just fine.

12:36.985 --> 12:40.196
So breathe easy.
I'm your dad and you are my son.

12:41.489 --> 12:43.616
Well, Daddy dearest
must head to the station.

12:43.658 --> 12:46.702
Do your best at school today,
Hayato.

12:50.915 --> 12:55.044
<i>Unrivaled…
He chose the word unrivaled.</i>

12:55.128 --> 12:59.628
<i>Which means there must be others
with the same kind of weird powers.</i>

13:00.758 --> 13:03.719
<i>But his confidence is terrifying…</i>

13:04.262 --> 13:05.721
<i>So he says he's unrivaled now.</i>

13:05.763 --> 13:08.599
<i>Does that mean he gained
some new power?</i>

13:09.684 --> 13:11.018
<i>What should I do?</i>

13:12.520 --> 13:16.565
<i>I have no idea
what I'm supposed to do.</i>

13:20.361 --> 13:21.653
You're…

13:21.696 --> 13:23.489
Hayato Kawajiri,

13:25.199 --> 13:26.200
am I right?

13:30.788 --> 13:33.415
DEADLY QUEEN

13:33.499 --> 13:36.668
JULY 16TH (FRI) 8:24 AM

13:34.208 --> 13:36.084
I've been waiting for you.

13:36.544 --> 13:36.690
My name is Rohan Kishibe.

13:38.755 --> 13:42.175
I have to say I'm very curious
about something.

13:43.426 --> 13:45.219
It's about this picture.

13:46.137 --> 13:47.763
This is you, right?

13:48.848 --> 13:52.184
And were you taking video
of your dad in the back there?

13:53.269 --> 13:54.270
Wait.

13:55.813 --> 13:56.939
<i>What… is this?</i>

13:58.816 --> 14:00.609
I know that was unexpected…

14:00.902 --> 14:03.029
Questioning him
would be so troublesome.

14:03.071 --> 14:06.616
Reading Hayato Kawajiri's mind
is much more efficient.

14:06.658 --> 14:09.619
Not to mention,
much more accurate too.

14:10.328 --> 14:11.829
[WARNING]
DO NOT READ ON.

14:12.038 --> 14:14.999
Huh? Why would that appear?

14:15.124 --> 14:17.417
The only thing Heaven's Door
should be revealing

14:17.460 --> 14:21.464
is a candid, honest written account
of this boy's life memories.

14:21.923 --> 14:24.509
And yet… a warning?

14:22.966 --> 14:25.718
[WARNING]
DO NOT READ ON.

14:24.592 --> 14:25.676
What the hell is going on?

14:26.094 --> 14:29.847
Is this "warning" part of
his experience?

14:30.556 --> 14:34.893
I wasn't planning on giving
this boy more than a quick peruse,

14:34.936 --> 14:37.355
but he's got me strangely hooked.

14:37.480 --> 14:39.982
[WARNING]
DO NOT READ ON.

14:37.772 --> 14:40.004
"Do not read on"?

14:40.525 --> 14:42.818
Who could this be for?

14:46.656 --> 14:48.032
AN OLD GUY WALKED BY
WITH HIS FLY DOWN.

14:49.283 --> 14:50.742
HE SNEEZED,
THEN EXCLAIMED, "DAMMIT."

14:50.785 --> 14:52.369
A WOMAN CHUCKLED.

14:52.578 --> 14:54.830
W-What is this?

14:54.956 --> 14:56.707
This is making less and less sense.

14:56.791 --> 14:57.792
What does all this mean?

15:00.753 --> 15:01.920
Dammit.

15:08.302 --> 15:11.180
Who is this kid?

15:11.014 --> 15:12.348
IT RAINED.

15:15.560 --> 15:19.730
Darn, the weather report
never said anything about rain!

15:22.233 --> 15:23.901
AT 8:27 AM, LIGHTNING STRUCK
ABOVE THE PEPSI SIGN.

15:26.654 --> 15:28.864
8:27…

15:36.748 --> 15:39.834
Who is this Hayato Kawajiri?

15:39.917 --> 15:41.752
How could he experience the future?

15:43.046 --> 15:45.256
Is he another Stand user?

15:49.260 --> 15:52.221
No… This wouldn't make sense
as a Stand ability.

15:52.263 --> 15:54.056
Heaven's Door reveals only

15:54.098 --> 15:56.391
what a person has actually
seen and heard.

15:56.684 --> 15:59.561
The explanation should be
somewhere in here…

16:00.563 --> 16:01.647
DAD ISN'T REALLY DAD.

16:01.689 --> 16:03.524
HE MADE SOME GUY AND GIRL
BLOW UP WITHOUT A TRACE AT
AN APARTMENT NEAR JOZENJI.

16:03.566 --> 16:05.067
HE'S A BLOOD-THIRSTY MURDERER.
I DISCOVERED HIS TRUE IDENTITY.
HE HAS SUPER-HUMAN POWER.

16:06.569 --> 16:07.528
MY DAD'S NAME IS YOSHIKAGE KIRA

16:07.570 --> 16:08.571
YOSHIKAGE KIRA

16:09.155 --> 16:10.364
Kira…

16:16.037 --> 16:18.039
I got it!

16:18.081 --> 16:20.291
This kid is the jackpot!

16:20.374 --> 16:21.833
I finally found him!

16:22.043 --> 16:24.795
Yoshikage Kira is Kosaku Kawajiri!

16:26.214 --> 16:28.591
He's disguised himself
as this kid's father!

16:32.845 --> 16:41.016
THEN ROHAN KISHIBE WAS KILLED.

16:36.516 --> 16:41.016
THE NEW, SUPERPOWERED KIRA
MURDERED HIM.

16:37.391 --> 16:40.727
Then Rohan Kishibe was killed?

16:42.897 --> 16:44.773
The new, superpowered Kira

16:45.525 --> 16:47.068
murdered him…

16:49.695 --> 16:53.240
Deadly Queen, bomb type three,
Bites the Dust.

16:53.282 --> 16:54.783
Heaven's Door!

16:59.831 --> 17:04.331
Rohan Kishibe, Deadly Queen
has already entered your pupil!

17:05.753 --> 17:07.796
Your visual perception
isn't deceiving you!

17:08.464 --> 17:12.964
Deadly Queen's bomb type three
has already been activated!

17:22.603 --> 17:25.105
Deadly Queen's new power…

17:25.314 --> 17:29.067
will annihilate all
who attempt to take me down!

17:29.110 --> 17:31.320
It's a bomb that will
activate in anyone

17:31.362 --> 17:33.489
who dares approach Hayato
to get to me.

17:33.656 --> 17:38.156
THEN ROHAN KISHIBE WAS KILLED.

17:34.198 --> 17:36.575
Hayato's verbalizing
of my true name

17:36.617 --> 17:38.160
will also activate the bomb,

17:38.244 --> 17:40.559
as will putting my name in writing.

17:40.872 --> 17:44.458
In other words,
I've planted the bomb on Hayato!

17:44.792 --> 17:46.835
I just remembered…

17:46.878 --> 17:51.378
I promised I'd meet Koichi
and the gang here at 8:30…

17:53.593 --> 17:58.093
I finally… discovered
Yoshikage Kira's true identity…

18:00.183 --> 18:04.478
Koichi'll be here any minute.
I have to tell him…

18:09.483 --> 18:13.528
I… I finally… found him…

18:14.530 --> 18:18.492
Yoshikage Kira is Kosaku Kawajiri.

18:18.576 --> 18:21.745
Heaven's Door found him.

18:23.497 --> 18:25.290
I have to tell…

18:27.001 --> 18:28.711
Koichi…

18:30.087 --> 18:31.338
And now,

18:31.505 --> 18:35.383
gaze upon the glory that is
Deadly Queen, bomb type three!

18:37.970 --> 18:41.390
K-Koichi!

18:55.029 --> 18:57.322
Was I dreaming?

19:01.911 --> 19:04.955
<i>I had a terrible night's sleep
last night.</i>

19:06.832 --> 19:09.543
<i>It was one horrible dream
after another…</i>

19:09.585 --> 19:11.003
Hayato!

19:11.045 --> 19:13.005
Just how long are you going to
stay sleeping, Hayato?

19:13.297 --> 19:14.923
It's time to get up and—

19:15.883 --> 19:19.011
What, you're already awake?

19:19.053 --> 19:20.387
You startled me.

19:20.638 --> 19:22.348
Hayato, breakfast.

19:22.473 --> 19:24.766
Geez, you could at least
try to answer…

19:27.687 --> 19:31.148
This… there's no question…

19:33.526 --> 19:34.735
<i>What? You're kidding!</i>

19:34.777 --> 19:37.112
<i>- We're on the air?</i>
- The morning news…

19:40.408 --> 19:44.120
Hayato! Hey, Hayato!
Could you answer the phone.

19:44.203 --> 19:46.079
<i>Th-This isn't a dream…</i>

19:47.081 --> 19:49.458
<i>None of that was a dream.</i>

19:50.084 --> 19:52.211
<i>Th-This is the same morning.</i>

19:52.628 --> 19:54.254
<i>It's repeating…</i>

19:54.297 --> 19:57.133
<i>I'm reliving yesterday's morning!</i>

19:57.883 --> 20:01.386
<i>Yoshikage Kira…
His name is Yoshikage Kira!</i>

20:01.762 --> 20:03.472
<i>He's behind all this!</i>

20:03.597 --> 20:06.474
<i>This is what he meant
by being unrivaled,</i>

20:06.559 --> 20:08.811
<i>he's done something to me
with his new power!</i>

20:09.228 --> 20:13.148
Hayato! Please answer the phone!

20:13.941 --> 20:15.150
<i>Oh, yeah!</i>

20:17.278 --> 20:18.279
Look out—

20:19.864 --> 20:21.657
Ow…

20:24.452 --> 20:28.164
Nice catch. It's like you knew
it was going to fall.

20:28.289 --> 20:30.916
But if your ears are still working,
try answering me next time!

20:31.959 --> 20:33.835
Hello, Kawajiri residence.

20:34.420 --> 20:38.920
- Huh? No, it's not.
<i>- So I'm the only one who knows</i>

20:39.258 --> 20:41.218
<i>this morning has
happened already.</i>

20:41.302 --> 20:43.971
It's like you knew
it was going to fall, huh?

20:45.723 --> 20:47.349
It appears you've returned
from a long day of

20:47.433 --> 20:49.476
blasting your friend
to kingdom come, Hayato.

20:52.938 --> 20:55.607
To tell you the truth,
I actually do not know

20:55.649 --> 20:58.401
the exact details
of your little foray.

20:58.486 --> 21:01.864
This type of Deadly Queen power
is called Bites the Dust,

21:02.865 --> 21:06.034
it automatically protects me…

21:06.118 --> 21:08.703
from inside your body, Hayato.

21:10.539 --> 21:14.834
I wonder if you are aware
that I killed you last night?

21:15.503 --> 21:17.213
As if someone up there had

21:17.296 --> 21:20.173
witnessed the despair
eating at my heart,

21:20.216 --> 21:23.510
I received a gift, a new ability.

21:24.178 --> 21:28.678
I tried the ability out on you,
and time reversed course one hour.

21:29.683 --> 21:32.727
The reality that I had murdered you
was no more.

21:33.187 --> 21:37.566
You also became my personal
life-protecting bomb.

21:38.317 --> 21:40.402
You told one of them about me,

21:40.444 --> 21:43.196
thereby activating the bomb and
transporting yourself back here.

21:44.365 --> 21:47.826
So who did you annihilate, hm?
You can tell me.

21:47.952 --> 21:49.870
Who did you murder?

21:50.287 --> 21:53.707
I-I didn't tell anyone…

21:54.708 --> 21:57.544
Of course! Then someone
must have interrogated you.

21:57.586 --> 21:59.421
That would be Rohan Kishibe.

21:59.505 --> 22:01.590
Even if spilling the beans
never crosses your mind,

22:01.674 --> 22:03.926
a simple inquiry about yours truly

22:04.009 --> 22:07.887
is enough to activate
Bites the Dust.

22:08.264 --> 22:11.600
Then, of course, you incinerate
your target and zip back here.

22:12.601 --> 22:14.227
Your visit with Rohan Kishibe

22:14.270 --> 22:16.605
is now just a figment
of your imagination!

22:16.647 --> 22:19.566
Now you know how Deadly Queen's
Bites the Dust works.

22:19.608 --> 22:22.110
My name will never leave your lips.

22:22.194 --> 22:25.322
No soul will ever live
to seek my identity!

23:38.812 --> 23:42.023
EPISODE 36
BITES THE DUST, PART 2
